\fs36 \cf0 1.1 How the buttons are organised\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Buttons are grouped exactly as configured:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Top row:
\f1\b0  \uc0\u55357 \u56341  STAND \'b7 \u55358 \u56977  SIT \'b7 \u55357 \u56395  HELLO \'b7 \u55357 \u56698  DANCE \'b7 \u55357 \u56580  TURN OVER (built-in pose buttons)\

\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 	\'95	\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Recovery (from upside down):
\f1\b0  \uc0\u8634  Recover left \'b7 \u8635  Recover right\

